{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年42歲的靚媽鍾嘉欣（Linda）與脊醫老公Jeremy婚後育有兩女一子，一家五口定居加拿大，生活寫意美滿。</p><p>雖然近年她間中會重返幕前開騷及出席活動，但一有時間便會全心陪伴子女享受家庭樂。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;嘉欣今日</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:23:57.046880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:15.155045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:15.155045+00:00","content_hash":"e678792bc19c055b98d3cd066083fb2b36613f4d1fbecbe8805669ac681742d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}